  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two spherical objects, X and Y, emit radiation at the same rate. The temperature of X is 200 K and its emissivity is <em>e</em>. The temperature of Y is 100 K and its emissivity is 2<em>e</em>. </p>\n<p>What is the ratio of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Radius  of  object  X}{Radius  of  object  Y}\"></span> ?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{16}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
